{
	"Site": "Nexus",
	"Id": 52642,
	"Name": "Kenneth's Tropical Farm",
	"Author": "Kf29",
	"Description": "[size=4][b]Kenneth's Tropical Farm - Content Patcher[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]This mod adds a tropical farm expansion inspired by Southeast Asia.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Includes 16 new crops such as Amaryllis, Aromatic Ginger, Arum Lily, Bougainvillea, Chinese Hibiscus, Crown Daisy, Kaffir Lime Leaves, Lemongrass, Longan, Snakefruit, Turmeric, Yucca and more.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Includes 4 new fruit trees such as Frangipani, Jambu, Rambutan and Sweetsop.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Includes new grocery ingredients such as Coconut Cream, Palm Sugar, Fish Sauce, Oyster Sauce and others.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Includes flower vases for decoration.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Includes 6 new cooking recipes such as Djamu, Grass Jelly Milk Tea, Lemongrass Tea, Tropical Fruit Punch and more.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]All crops are seasonal and balanced for vanilla gameplay. Some are regrowable and some are trellis crops.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Seeds and saplings are sold at Kenneth's Seed Shop.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Grocery ingredients and vases are sold at Kenneth's Grocery Store.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Designed to fit naturally into the game with no clutter.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Credits:[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Sprites and art assets by SSaturn0601, used with permission.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Original Mod: https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5585[/b][/size]",
	"PageUrl": "https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/52642",
